        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji uo Mwana wa Ng'ondi oreghufungueghe ugho muhuri ghwa kasanu, nerewonieghe aisi ya madhabahu roho ra wandu werebwaghiloghe kwa wundu ghwa ijo ilagho ja Mlungu, na kwa wundu ghwa wushuhuda werekoghe nagho; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawo wikakema kwa lwaka lubaa wikighamba, “Ee Bwana kuwadie nguma, mweli na mloli, ni lii kuchaatanya na kudiluya lugho bagha yedu kwa wandu wiko ndoenyi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko kula umu orenekeloghe nguwo ndacha ya chokwa, wikazerwa wichurie kuhoresha katini, hata mtalo ghukate ghwa wadumiki wambao, na waruna awo werekoghe wibwagho sa awo weni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
